sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant VoiceUI as VoiceAssistant Screen
    participant Speech as Web Speech API (Browser RAM)
    participant API as POST /api/v1/voice/chat
    participant Gateway as Backend AI Orchestrator

    User->>VoiceUI: Tap Microphone & Speak
    VoiceUI->>Speech: Start Ephemeral Speech Recognition
    Speech-->>VoiceUI: Transcribed Text String (Audio bytes dropped in RAM)
    VoiceUI->>API: HTTP POST /api/v1/voice/chat { messageText }
    API->>Gateway: Ground query with Classical RAG + Safety Filter
    Gateway-->>API: 200 OK { responseText, groundedCitations, disclaimer }
    API-->>VoiceUI: Display Grounded Text Response + Audio Synthesis
